Source: https://github.com/OK1BR/log-for-linux
Comment:
 Installed by the .deb only (packaging/nfpm.yaml, packager: deb) — the
 machine-readable summary Debian Policy 12.5 asks for. The full licence
 texts travel with every package format: the GPL as
 /usr/share/licenses/log-for-linux/LICENSE, the MIT notice of cty.dat and
 the LGPL of the bundled Adwaita icons under /usr/share/log-for-linux/.

